# 10. SMART IRRIGATION

The irrigation system must not simply turn the motor ON whenever soil moisture is low.

Use multiple parameters:

```text
Soil Moisture
+
Crop Requirement
+
Crop Growth Stage
+
Weather Forecast
+
Rain Probability
+
Root-Zone Condition
+
Water Availability
+
Previous Irrigation
```

Generate an irrigation recommendation.

Example:

```text
IRRIGATION RECOMMENDATION

Field: Field 01
Crop: Tomato
Growth Stage: Flowering

Current Soil Moisture: 32%
Expected Rain: 70%
Water Availability: Medium

AI Recommendation:
Delay irrigation for 6 hours.

Reason:
Rain probability is high and soil moisture is
currently sufficient for the crop.
```

---

# 11. IMPORTANT: EDGE CONTROL + AI DECISION SUPPORT

Do not make the entire irrigation system dependent on cloud AI.

The ESP32 should have a local safety/control layer.

Example:

```text
ESP32
 ↓
Read Soil Moisture
 ↓
Check Local Threshold
 ↓
Emergency Irrigation Logic
 ↓
Motor Control
```

Cloud AI provides higher-level recommendations:

```text
AI
 ↓
Weather
 ↓
Crop Stage
 ↓
Historical Data
 ↓
Water Availability
 ↓
Irrigation Recommendation
```

This makes the architecture more reliable.

